        "title": "feat: add Mistral balance metrics",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- show Mistral available credit balance from the authenticated billing session\n- preserve API spend and Monthly Plan usage while preventing balance-only accounts from rendering a fake percentage meter\n- keep the undocumented credits endpoint optional and failure-tolerant, with regression coverage for parsing, provider ordering, menu cards, icons, and switcher metrics\n\nSupersedes https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar/pull/1779 after GitHub rejected the maintainer update to the contributor fork because the active OAuth token lacks workflow scope. The original contribution and exact head remain preserved; this single current-main commit retains contributor credit.\n\n## Validation\n\n- contributor authenticated proof: https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar/pull/1779#issuecomment-4879313192\n- `swift test --filter 'Mistral|StatusItemAnimationSignatureTests|StatusItemBalanceDisplayTests|StatusItemControllerMenuTests'` (88 tests, 9 suites)\n- `make check`\n- `make test` (46 shards)\n- autoreview: clean, 0.86 confidence\n- `CODEXBAR_DISABLE_KEYCHAIN_ACCESS=1 ./Scripts/compile_and_run.sh`; production bundle signed, launched, and stayed running; SecurityAgent absent\n\n## Risk\n\nThe Mistral credits endpoint is undocumented and may drift. Failures are intentionally contained so existing Vibe usage, API spend, and Monthly Plan data remain available.\n",
